flowchart TD
    Request[ABP asks for AppFeatures.MaxProjects<br/>acme-max-projects] --> Customer[Tenant or user maps to Subscrio customer]
    Customer --> Override{Subscription override?}
    Override -->|Yes: 250| Result[ABP receives 250]
    Override -->|No| Plan{Plan value?}
    Plan -->|Yes: 100| PlanResult[ABP receives 100]
    Plan -->|No| Default[ABP feature default: 3]
